    pageItem P220_NALOG_ID (
        type: selectOne
        label {
            label: Izvod
            alignment: left
        }
        settings {
            infiniteScroll: false
        }
        lov {
            type: sqlQuery
            sqlQuery:
                ```sql
                SELECT
                    broj || ' - ' || opis AS d,
                    id as r
                FROM
                    vw_glavna_knjiga
                WHERE
                    ooj_id = :APP_OOJ_ID
                    AND godina = :APP_GODINA
                    AND lower(vrsta_naloga_sifra) = 'iz'
                    AND ooj_banka_id = :P220_OOJ_BANKA_ID
                    AND proknjizeno = :P220_PROKNJIZENO
                    AND (datum_dokumenta = :P220_DATUM OR :P220_DATUM IS null)
                ORDER BY
                    to_number(broj) DESC
                ```
        }
